Short:        Multitasking tutorial.
Author:       jeroen@infothuis.nl (Jeroen Knoester)
Uploader:     jeroen infothuis nl (Jeroen Knoester)
Type:         dev/c
Requires:     Kickstart 2.0+, C compiler
Architecture: m68k-amigaos

Helloworld is a multitasking demo in C. It shows
how to create tasks and processes on the amiga and
how to communicate basic information between those 
tasks.

It's part of Power Programs Amiga Features. Check out
the website on 

http://www.infothuis.nl/jeroen/amigafeatures.html

Enjoy!
